  "behavior": {
    "commonRoot": "One app-owned preparation and exactly one opened store supplied to assembly; shared SwiftUI Home/Practice/Stats and native workflows. No legacy writer is opened by normal application startup.",
    "selection": "Existing handoff takes precedence; fresh-native selection uses an existing durable import-receipt row without schema changes. Activated/logout paths never inspect stale legacy credentials or restart the old writer. Failed preparation retains source and explicit retry.",
    "refresh": "Read-only refresh does not save credentials or upload the outbox; account-bound automatic sending uses confirmed pending work only.",
    "background": "Built-in SwiftUI backgroundTask(.appRefresh), system schedule/reschedule, cancellation checks and explicit shared synchronization. Background helper does not start an independent automatic worker.",
    "input": "One shared Japanese UIKit boundary on iOS, native SwiftUI field on Mac. Marked-text/caret, kana conversion and keyboard policy retained. Responder changes occur after view-update transactions.",
    "settings": "Full shared review/timing/keyboard controls; live validated API endpoint; app-owned compatible avatar cache; native store diagnostic copy; confirmed logout.",
    "home": "Same compact inset list and WaniKani palette as prior checkpoint; level-up timing now uses typed shared cached SRS data and an explicit clock.",
    "activities": "SwiftUI userActivity preserves scheduled review/lesson search and Siri identities. Native and legacy hosts share one metadata implementation; prediction eligibility is an iOS-only capability. Modern AppIntents discovery remains open.",
    "data": "Saved Work follows committed store changes. No new app Tools driver, runtime hardcoded source JSON or SQL dataset."
