  "corrections": [
    "Initial input regression hung after disabling/resigning UITextField synchronously inside updateUIView. Exact synthetic-process stack sample identified SwiftUI responder graph recursion. Deferring enabled/keyboard/focus and teardown changes fixed practice dismissal and grading.",
    "Saved Work loaded once and could display a sent answer. Its task now observes committed store changes.",
    "Startup could finish after scene activation and miss starting automatic synchronization. A scene-keyed SwiftUI task waits for shared preparation and starts the worker only for an active, uncancelled scene; lesson/review outboxes then drain automatically.",
    "Native form rows are lazy; settings/account tests scroll to controls, activate the switch thumb and dismiss the topmost system popover when no Cancel button is shown. Cold subject routes assert native subject content instead of a retired scroll identifier. These do not replace or disable actual functionality.",
    "The old UIKit activity adapter lacked actor isolation. Calling shared activity metadata exposed that mismatch at compile time; the adapter is now explicitly MainActor-isolated."
  ],
